# 57. PART I ACCEPTANCE INVARIANTS

# =============================================================================

Evaluate:

DATA-001

Canonical ownership exists.

DATA-002

Information lifecycle is explicit.

DATA-003

Classification is explicit.

DATA-004

Retention is explicit.

DATA-005

Privacy ownership is explicit.

DATA-006

Metadata is consistent.

DATA-007

Lineage is recoverable.

DATA-008

Repository information architecture is internally consistent.

