serialization form

forward compatibility

# =============================================================================

# 92. CONTRACT INVARIANTS

# =============================================================================

Recover cross-field invariants.

Examples:

completed tasks must have completion timestamps

failed tasks must have failure information

cancelled tasks must have cancellation source

running services must have start timestamps

stopped services must not report active resources

checkpoint manifests must declare schema versions

Determine enforcement location.

