# =============================================================================

# 102. REFERENTIAL INTEGRITY

# =============================================================================

Determine how references among Core records are validated.

Possible references:

task to parent task

service to dependencies

component to owner

resource to allocator

event to publisher

checkpoint to runtime

tree contract to package

Determine behavior for missing targets.

