timezone

precision

monotonic versus wall clock

serialization

clock-skew handling

Determine whether ordering-critical operations use monotonic time.

# =============================================================================

# 105. PATH INTEGRITY

# =============================================================================

Audit stored paths.

Determine whether paths are:

absolute

repository-relative

package-relative

canonicalized

