# =============================================================================

# 202. IMPLEMENTATION RESTRICTION

# =============================================================================

This audit shall not automatically implement missing governance systems.

It shall first identify:

existing authorities

existing contracts

existing provenance fields

existing retention mechanisms

existing deletion mechanisms

existing privacy controls

schema conflicts

ownership conflicts

unsupported future domains

Do not create speculative infrastructure merely to satisfy an audit heading.

Do not treat future cognitive subsystems as missing Core implementation.

Do not claim legal or regulatory compliance.

Do not broaden the scope beyond Core without explicit authorization.

