# =============================================================================

# PHASE 3.7.21 FINAL STATUS

# =============================================================================

Upon completion of Parts I and II, determine:

CERTIFIED

CERTIFIED WITH OBSERVATIONS

CONDITIONALLY CERTIFIED

NOT CERTIFIED

The result applies only to Core data infrastructure currently present within
the declared audit scope.

Future cognitive information systems require separate audits after their
implementation.

